  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Education of Bosnian police instructors in conflict managemen to support the development of the Bosnian police force into a professional institution, based on respect for human rights. The target group is instructors from the police academies in Sarajevo and Banja Luka and the local police districts of both entities.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Utbildning av bosniska polisinstrukt&#xf6;rer i konflikthantering f&#xf6;r att st&#xf6;dja polisk&#xe5;rens utveckling mot professionalism och h&#xf6;ga etiska v&#xe4;rderingar. M&#xe5;lgruppen &#xe4;r instrukt&#xf6;rer fr&#xe5;n polish&#xf6;gskolorna i Sarajevo och Banja Luka och de lokala polisdistrikten i b&#xe5;da entiteterna.</narrative>
  </description>
